{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CCEx82bKw51794494700.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>輝達股價早段急挫一成四，曾經跌穿150美元。</p><p></p><p>輝達公布，黃仁勳辭去行政總裁、首席執行官及董事會成員職務，即時生效。</p><p></p><p>副總裁兼財務總監克雷斯同意擔任臨時首席執行官。董事會已啟動正式行政總裁遴選工作，並將考慮內部和外部候選人。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T16:03:55.286416+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T14:34:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T13:35:28.740577+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T15:57:16.906487+00:00","content_hash":"bdf7ccff4402a77ca2b33a52e5238996d83750ed16fec9aa61c53f52945af320","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T16:03:55.286416+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}